From: MCC45TR <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Register isolated SM7675 native display providers on Linux 7.2.10

OEM Cliffs resources, linuxgamer O82 handoff and Palawan catalog are
adapted to the 7.2.10 DRM, pointer-link ICC and clock interfaces.
This experimental patch does not enable a native DT graph.

